  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas expands in volume from $1 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{~m}^3$ to $1 \\times 10^{-2} \\mathrm{~m}^3$ at $300 \\mathrm{~K}$ against a constant pressure of $1 \\times 10^5 \\mathrm{Nm}^{-2}$. The work done is",
